Subject: [PATCH] config: read only requested sysfs attributes during matching
Full ancestor attribute enumeration performs hardware I/O for unrelated
attributes on every matcher. This blocks the manager command queue both
before composite creation and while composites await target creation.
Reject cheap subsystem/sysname mismatches first and look up only named
attributes, preserving nearest-ancestor, empty-value and glob semantics.

